<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Patna to Hyderabad | Express Container Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad’s car transport service from Patna to Hyderabad different from other movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad combines a dedicated fleet of hydraulic‑ramp trailers, ISO‑9001:2015 quality management, and 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. With over 22,000 successful moves and a 4.9/5 Google rating, we guarantee zero‑scratch delivery, live GPS tracking, and full compliance with RTO and e‑Way bill regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the Patna‑to‑Hyderabad car relocation typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 1,485 km journey via NH 44 and NH 33 usually requires 3‑4 business days, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Our real‑time GPS monitoring lets you track progress, and we plan optimal rest stops to maintain a steady, safe transit speed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for moving a car from Patna to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original registration certificate, valid insurance, Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate, a temporary transit permit, and an e‑Way bill generated under GST. Our team assists in preparing and filing each document to ensure a smooth handover.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport price?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. This protects against loss or damage during loading, transit, and unloading, reinforcing our zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I request door‑to‑door service for my vehicle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our door‑to‑door option includes pickup from your Patna address, secure loading onto our hydraulic ramp trailer, and final delivery to your desired location in Hyderabad. Additional fees are transparently listed in the cost breakdown.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the joint inspection process work before loading my car?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A joint inspection is conducted with you and our loading supervisor. We document the vehicle’s exterior condition using a detailed checklist and photographs, then both parties sign the inspection report. This ensures any pre‑existing damage is recorded before transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken to prevent scratches during loading?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our technicians use a hydraulic ramp with anti‑slip surfaces, secure the vehicle with a 4‑wheel lock, and place edge‑padding and high‑density foam protectors around vulnerable panels. These steps, combined with our trained crew, guarantee a scratch‑free journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
